+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is enabled in all builds, development builds included; there is no build in which it is turned off. This is consistent with the project's standing decision to use HTTPS everywhere with no exceptions, so certificate verification applies to every HTTPS connection.
